        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    taxable_income = 75000\n    brackets = [\n        (0, 20000, 0.10),\n        (20000, 50000, 0.15),\n        (50000, float(\"inf\"), 0.20),\n    ]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_tax = 0.0\n\n    for lower_bound, upper_bound, rate in brackets:\n        if taxable_income > lower_bound:\n            income_in_bracket = min(taxable_income, upper_bound) - lower_bound\n            total_tax += income_in_bracket * rate\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(total_tax)\n```",
